---

<section id="hero" class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        안녕하세요.<br />
        <span class="highlight">협업과 성장을 추구하는</span><br />
        웹 개발자 이호진입니다.
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-subtitle">
        7년간의 웹 개발 경험을 바탕으로<br />
        확장 가능하고 안정적인 서비스를 만들어갑니다.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-buttons">
        <a href="#projects" class="btn">Experience</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-outline">Contact</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f8f9fa 0%, #ffffff 100%);
    padding-top: 80px;
  }

  .hero-content {
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: #2c2c2c;
  }

  .highlight {
    color: #f9c51d;
    position: relative;
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: #666;
    margin-bottom: 50px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .hero-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-outline {
    background: transparent;
    color: #2c2c2c;
    border: 2px solid #f9c51d;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    background: #f9c51d;
    color: #2c2c2c;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 100px;
      min-height: 90vh;
    }
    
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .hero-subtitle {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    
    .hero-buttons {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
    }
    
    .btn {
      width: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>